WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:06.240
baden-powell founder of the Boy Scouts&nbsp;
in 1908 inspects new scouts in London&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:12.660
years later veteran of early African&nbsp;
and Indian campaigns baden-powell&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:16.380
received a peerage for creating&nbsp;
the boy and girl stock movements

